# Local development only

- This project is local code only. Use localhost for previews.
- Do not create hosted Sites, deploy, publish, upload the project, or push its source to a remote service.
- Requests to build, fix, preview, or improve this app do not authorize hosting or deployment.
- Only a new, explicit user request to publish or deploy can change this restriction.
- Keep hosting configuration and deployment workflows out of this project.
- Do not create, modify, or run automated tests unless the user explicitly requests tests. Use code inspection, type checks, builds, and focused manual verification instead.
